{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：18:30 2026-11-13 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如合體馬來西亞「姐姐」挑戰湊仔Staycation  出浴滾床畫面曝光\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c5cb39301cf420590f3a23151fb87752/2026-11/kf_3.jpg\"/>\n<p>黃翠如於今年9月曾帶同囝囝一家三口去馬來西亞旅行兼探朋友，今日（13日）黃翠如與馬來西亞視后閨密吳天瑜（Debbie），一同在社交平台發文，分享「第一次兩個媽媽帶着兩個兒子staycation」的照片及影片，充滿溫馨。</p>\n<h2>黃翠如為吳天瑜慶祝48歲生日</h2>\n<p>黃翠如與吳天瑜是圈中著名的閨密，11月8日正是吳天瑜的48歲生日，黃翠如特別帶同兒子陪伴吳天瑜兩母子，慶祝好友生日。黃翠如在小紅書的帖文中，還稱呼吳天瑜為「姐姐」：「生日快樂，我的馬來西亞姐姐！」黃翠如表示此行「準備了兩件媽媽姊妹衫，和兩套兒子兄弟衫，三天兩夜非常混亂，但同時充滿愛，充滿喜樂，那一天你們長大了，會帶我們這兩個媽媽staycation嗎？」</p>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如早前一家三口到馬來西亞旅行。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/03c7b17baff6b0a06b602dfcb39453ce/2026-09/haPPy_haPPPy_100_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如此行探望好友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6fd394077a9848baa12eb1661274746d/2026-09/9_1_20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如、蕭正楠與「蕭哈哈」終於到達目的地，與朋友見面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4199abc68494aaed8a90991446fec0d7/2026-09/24_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"眾人開心合照，慶祝「蕭哈哈」成功抵達馬來西亞。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/35e2255009bf2a1a56708154be9fa661/2026-09/25_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜首次兩個媽媽帶着兩個兒子一齊Staycation。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b22649342d25b2aa18e3e57a20d19ea9/2026-11/Priscilla_5_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"此行黃翠如為吳天瑜慶祝48歲生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/26a64db5d143ddd2b47a534b5d83b405/2026-11/Priscilla_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜坐上度假村的接駁高爾夫球車表現興奮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/78ff52f5706179d9ab909cf87dbd438c/2026-11/CAP_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如去到邊都打卡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6ca50e8e5fe8190c62c5dff6369e675d/2026-11/CAP_6__0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜到達後即去做SPA。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/07a55e88bb7ae74216de0c5106c8da1b/2026-11/CAP_8_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳天瑜的兒子抱起黃翠如的囝囝全程照顧。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e6b779876103602c67f0b816d0423722/2026-11/Priscilla_4_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜玩到癲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/45f323819038eb743cd277364761d94c/2026-11/Priscilla_6_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"四人又躺在奢華的大床上嬉戲滾床。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b3c3531fb7840babbcb58d67f6d4a7f2/2026-11/Priscilla_7_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜的囝囝穿上兄弟裝，玩得開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f2f8702c11242cfd3fccc392a92af627/2026-11/CAP_27_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如囝囝跟吳天瑜的兒子一齊沖涼。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ee5d231d92bedb46049afac1dbb13099/2026-11/Priscilla_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如、吳天瑜一行四人住套房，有專屬的私人泳池。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/44ce36ba5495d4a503a42412f81757d7/2026-11/Priscilla_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如一家三口在機場自拍，記錄溫馨時刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d8cc02806b2496928fe75d96f6d578f4/2026-09/9_5_6.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"蕭正楠使用孭帶，全程親力親為照顧兒子。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/72d958cc7cad217d6f93bc353aff077e/2026-09/14_1_2.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"登機前，「蕭哈哈」已經「冇電」並在爸爸懷中熟睡。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/95fdd8824159bec5b80e1d5689ff45bd/2026-09/18_0_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"上機後，「蕭哈哈」全程在媽媽黃翠如懷中安睡，被讚是「好湊」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/373a0be807efa23856cceb693671253f/2026-09/19_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"抵達馬來西亞後，「蕭哈哈」馬上叉足電，在機場奔跑。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b70cce023f9dddd5c2591117da2e4f9c/2026-09/21_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"「蕭哈哈」與契哥在車上見面，二人互動可愛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c745425064c4e433ec923f66d004e4e0/2026-09/22.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"契哥為「蕭哈哈」穿鞋仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/afafdb5d81aaabc159f0dd558b7bba9c/2026-09/23_0.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"「蕭哈哈」為契媽亂改名「宜家」。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0c366986251539f0e9ca09f6910eaff4/2026-09/IKEA.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「蕭哈哈」向契哥求抱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/51548c6708655024dee4256de19531a2/2026-09/0_3.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如寫道：「他最愛的人，他的哥哥（契哥）。有幾次哈哈發脾氣，哥哥說『哈哈只是眼瞓了』」，足見兄弟情深。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/89c87d67e86cc4b27b5fffb714476142/2026-09/2_7_19.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如分享了多個「蕭哈哈」的可愛時刻。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/21754fa9b9ca37c6f0539e5b4bcef49e/2026-09/1_9_13.png\"/>\n<h2>黃翠如吳天瑜「姊妹裝」歎Spa</h2>\n<p>從影片中見到，黃翠如與吳天瑜興奮地坐上度假村的接駁高爾夫球車，兩人戴著墨鏡與鴨舌帽，對著鏡頭熱情招手。二人難得放下家庭，一抵達度假村便直奔享受專屬的Spa放鬆時光。黃翠如與吳天瑜又換上同款的白色浴袍，在鏡頭前搞笑熱舞、對鏡自拍，展現如少女般的青春活力。</p>\n<p>除兩位媽媽黃翠如與吳天瑜的閨密穿搭，二人的兒子同樣換上同款兄弟裝，兩個小朋友一入到寬敞的度假套房便非常興奮，化身「小小探險家」在客房內跑來跑去。影片記錄小朋友的純真爆笑瞬間，見到「竹簍套頭」搞笑大作戰，又在地上爬來爬去，惹得兩位媽媽哈哈大笑。</p>\n<h2>黃翠如帶小朋友驚喜為吳天瑜慶祝</h2>\n<p>吳天瑜的兒子不但抱起黃翠如的囝囝全程照顧，兩個小朋友又一起脫光光泡在大浴缸裡玩水，四人又躺在奢華的大床上嬉戲滾床。而套房內有專屬的私人泳池，黃翠如與吳天瑜跟兩人的兒子坐在池邊，開心地對著鏡頭比愛心，玩得盡興。黃翠如還跟小朋友穿上睡衣，捧住蛋糕為吳天瑜慶祝生日，畫面溫馨。</p>\n<h2>黃翠如好友吳天瑜居於馬來西亞：</h2>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜非常老友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/0672b118f664f63b83795e9fbbe5f7f6/2022-04/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-04-15%20at%201.53.43%20PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如好錫吳天瑜囝囝。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/be8124502a9fc2d41c4cf6ca47e2003d/2022-04/WhatsApp%20Image%202022-04-15%20at%201.53.44%20PM.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜熟稔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/dd54c8e95508925cfdb0bdeb40fcc917/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278_02.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如去大馬會住在吳天瑜家中。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/77d960385d99f0be36012025bd8a2806/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜是好姊妹。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/594c3e84e0347ca0a4d6d04303d64001/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如會陪吳天瑜囝囝玩。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7078012d83ec9b33452197236343384a/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278_04.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳天瑜屋企好大。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bb35beedc23067507c3d0e418b9b3263/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278_07.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友與黃翠如好熟。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b57e74ab5cccbd5ffa55b832d120645c/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278_12.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"廚房屬於開放式設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c1b2e1c0ee1618545812066c0e3f2490/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204641278_13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"地方相當闊落。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8e0d3ae421d5d0ea9b3eb6ccc5166cbd/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204710197_03.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全屋以落地玻璃設計。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/1b7ba8f6326bbdb16ded70ee4592c2c5/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204710197_06.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"全屋設計以純白色為主，有樓梯上更高樓層。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7d3f2357b5d48a1c2410f640fad63365/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204710197_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"估計面積至少逾千呎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/063f6b30a54aaed8114ce1ab14ddd08d/2022-10/KakaoTalk_20221026_204710197_10.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳天瑜囝囝準備禮物送給黃翠如。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a889f00227f2860f145118bcde81c75d/2023-07/priscilla_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如收到「情信」。​\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/721a7b42c1ab79b55082f51e25e13f9b/2023-07/priscilla_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"黃翠如與吳天瑜母子玩得好開心。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/81774b14b1bd530e66be376a94e53b87/2023-07/priscilla_4.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友玩都轉身。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/49f9759246c5551e5b13f9c9b67a3aaa/2023-07/priscilla_5.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"吳天瑜囝囝先用手拍黃翠如塊面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/82de343b4652da04a02990149bc6400e/2023-07/priscilla_6.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"小朋友再出腳踢黃翠如面。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/2f83ccc88cbe0cdb7abee2123c7a6e52/2023-07/priscilla_7.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"然後小朋友手腳並用，黃翠如慘被糟質。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f09bda37f4af0f88e9ea6cd34442fc3d/2023-07/priscilla_8.jpg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T11:20:26.927377+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":762,"images":47,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T10:30:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T11:54:28.045712+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T11:13:53.006187+00:00","content_hash":"6255e25383072a453c774b5e0bf2ce3db8273d344452a2a8406180ed8e66da2b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}